{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:53 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:39 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:39 2026-10-15 HKT</p><p>油塘發生火警。今日（15日）早上10時49分，油麗邨秀麗樓9樓一單位起火冒煙，多人報案。據報起火單位一名年長女住戶和兒子被困屋內，亦有大廈居民被困於後樓梯。</p><p>救援人員趕到現場，消防員出動一條喉及一煙帽隊灌救，約半小時後將火救熄。現場消息稱，起火單位71歲姓林婦人獲救，她吸入濃煙不適，清醒由救護車送往聯合醫院治理；另外約有百名居民疏散。人員經初步調查，相信是有風扇燈電線短路引致火災。</p><img alt=\"秀麗樓單位發生火警。讀者提供圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ce36e95d5bf417235eace4805067f28/2026-10/4_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"居民疏散。讀者提供圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29fb4d9ed587f5444f1e7fb8a7c766a/2026-10/2_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送院。讀者提供圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4aeb3fe2e197e6595f6dfa7abef1ef2/2026-10/1_1_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"fb「油塘人之家」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d94ff2151d798f6056136bd50a581395/2026-10/3_45.jpg\"/><img alt=\"居民疏散落樓暫避。讀者提供圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7380db46abb12f844113e338829d4558/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_11_41_59_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/002c53e80b2baee231f8aa21b891a426/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_00_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防射水灌救。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50b489327b205333b7751eeabd2865a1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_00_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1697d94b63aa1cd60846ff1ec7da234a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_00_14.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.941618+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:53:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:18:23.062255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:07.957768+00:00","content_hash":"f3ec7f7f5f5909a10e9a5b12dbd6c2311d66fddc119bad56f1dfd3608bdafa4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}